{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-2-3","kind":"proposition","title":"线段分割与矩形面积分解","englishTitle":"If a straight line be cut at random, the rectangle contained by the whole and one of the segments is equal to the rectangle contained by the segments and the square on the aforesaid segment.","book":2,"number":3,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.3","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.3/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":3,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷二"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-2-3@raw-23a33a56cfa566ba","contentId":"euclid-2-3","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"23a33a56cfa566bad2c320190ad04aa33cfcff26825f0ddebe7ad7893acaff18","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-2-3.statement","euclid-2-3.construction.1","euclid-2-3.construction.2","euclid-2-3.proof.1","euclid-2-3.proof.2","euclid-2-3.proof.3","euclid-2-3.conclusion","euclid-2-3.historical.1","euclid-2-3.historical.2","euclid-2-3.historical.3","euclid-2-3.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-2-3.statement","contentId":"euclid-2-3","revisionId":"euclid-2-3@raw-23a33a56cfa566ba","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0038b26dd15ab2917cebd9c9d28093ea381eb6dfbe4734a3142623f1039561e8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a straight line be cut at random, the rectangle contained by the whole and one of the segments is equal to the rectangle contained by the segments and the square on the aforesaid segment."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一条直线随机切除,则由整条和其中一部分组成的矩形等于各段组成的矩形和上述部分的正方形。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线任两分之其元线任偕一分线矩内直角形与分馀线偕一分线矩内直角形及一分线上直角方形并等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"对于任意一条直线的一半，原始线等于二等分线的矩形及余数矩形与二等分内矩形和分割线上的正方形之和。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-3.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-2-3","revisionId":"euclid-2-3@raw-23a33a56cfa566ba","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3e0b9093b3811b4d64462bfcbdbceee03e5a56f04043db3278a2e07fc2a60e38","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the straight line AB be cut at random at C; I say that the rectangle contained by AB, BC is equal to the rectangle contained by AC, CB together with the square on BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将AB线任意剪切,在C处;我说,AB,BC组成的矩形等于AC,CB和C对BC组成的矩形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-3.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-2-3","revisionId":"euclid-2-3@raw-23a33a56cfa566ba","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"88baa501737f947d9e45f4d55cded21e4198de26fc24ab9c29f20c14563e531b","citations":["euclid-1-46","euclid-1-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the square CDEB be described on CB; [[I. 46](/principles/euclid-1-46)] let ED be drawn through to F, and through A let AF be drawn parallel to either CD or BE. [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"关于正方形 CDEB,请在CB上说明;让 ED 通过 F通过A让AF与CD或BE平行。 [[I. 46](/principles/euclid-1-46)] [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-3.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-2-3","revisionId":"euclid-2-3@raw-23a33a56cfa566ba","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fb50c9032edede94383f49a214a980814a765640bc53bc38782753eb43b90af5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then AE is equal to AD, CE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE等于AD,CE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-3.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-2-3","revisionId":"euclid-2-3@raw-23a33a56cfa566ba","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fd2501d8bfbb500dbadd9b8c1913ea0f0c81ac2ec28a008c5d9df228ba18879a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now AE is the rectangle contained by AB, BC, for it is contained by AB, BE, and BE is equal to BC;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE是AB,BC组成的矩形,AB,BE,BE等于BC;"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-3.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-2-3","revisionId":"euclid-2-3@raw-23a33a56cfa566ba","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ddfc57be8737cb05b8ec4b5dbf43e4f9e996a00a8c353bb1d9880c6ff229cad3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"AD is the rectangle AC, CB, for DC is equal to CB; and DB is the square on CB. Therefore the rectangle contained by AB, BC is equal to the rectangle contained by AC, CB together with the square on BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AD是矩形 AC,CB,DC等于CB;DB是CB,正方形,AB,BC等于矩形,AC,BC和正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-3.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-2-3","revisionId":"euclid-2-3@raw-23a33a56cfa566ba","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-3.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-2-3","revisionId":"euclid-2-3@raw-23a33a56cfa566ba","order":7,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cf929e259f81e0c4ce199136370795b14bc3b697b62585b0ae1689202e5e2474","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线任两分之其元线任偕一分线矩内直角形与分馀线偕一分线矩内直角形及一分线上直角方形并等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"对于任意一条直线的一半，原始线等于二等分线的矩形及余数矩形与二等分内矩形和分割线上的正方形之和。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-3.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-2-3","revisionId":"euclid-2-3@raw-23a33a56cfa566ba","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ef8b0afc5b7801b98765c8925f21f9a922c56edef471012e636f31e7c3275284","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙线任两分于丙题言元线甲乙任偕一分线如甲丙矩内直角形〈不论〉〈甲丙为长分为短分〉与分馀丙乙偕甲丙矩线内直角形及甲丙上直角方形并等论曰试作甲丁直角方形从乙界作乙巳垂线与甲戊平行〈一卷卅一〉而于戊丁引长之遇于己其甲戊与甲丙等则甲己直角形在元线甲乙偕一分线甲丙矩内丙丁与甲丙等则丙己直角形在一分线甲丙偕分馀线丙乙矩内而甲己直角形与甲丙丙乙矩线内丙己直角形及甲丙上甲丁直角方形并等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"说明如下：甲乙，线 丙 的任意两部分，命题说明：原线 甲乙，任意一条分支线，如矩形 甲丙 内的 〈不论〉〈甲丙为长分为短分〉 及 丙乙 和 甲丙 的余数，矩阵内矩形和 甲丙 上正方形相等。证明如下：原型 甲丁 正方形：从边界 乙 出发，画一条与 甲戊 和 〈一卷卅一〉 平行的垂直线，在 戊丁 延伸至 己。如果 甲戊 和 甲丙 相同，则矩形 甲己 位于主图 甲乙 和分割线 甲丙 内。如果 丙丁 和 甲丙 在分割内，则矩形 丙己 位于分割线 甲丙 和余线 丙乙 内，而矩形 甲己 和 甲丙丙乙 位于矩阵 丙己 内，矩阵 丙己 和 甲丁 上的正方形之和等于 甲丙。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-3.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-2-3","revisionId":"euclid-2-3@raw-23a33a56cfa566ba","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cfc62964e8c6f58117182d61683ac4cb2b41b10b6e3f042231ddcefac277e8b9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"注曰：以数明之设十数任两分之为七为三如前图则十乘七为七十与七乘三之实二十一及七自之羃四十九并等如后图十乘三为三十与七乘三之实二十一及三之羃九并等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"注释：用数字说明，将数字十分成两部分得到七，如前图所示，则十乘七等于七十，七乘三的平方之和为二十一，加上七的平方，如下图所示。十乘三等于三十，七乘三的实际二十一与三个九的平方之和。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-3.source","contentId":"euclid-2-3","revisionId":"euclid-2-3@raw-23a33a56cfa566ba","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bcbf13a4d7e7901f2720d4f21ac7e6cdf63bbb246634ad009b586359536c846d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.3/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.3\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷二"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-2-3:euclid-1-46:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-2-3","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-2-3.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-46","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.3","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.3/","sourceLabel":"I. 46"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-2-3:euclid-1-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-2-3","sourceBlockIds":[